### EasyCoin API Test Suite
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ----------------------------------------------------
### MODULE 1: AUTH & BIOMETRICS (FRIEND 1)
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Request Voice OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/voice-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+919876543210"
}

### 1.2 Verify OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "otp": "4821"
}

### 1.3 Biometric Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/biometric-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "biometricSignature": "fingerprint_webauthn_sample_hash"
}

### 1.4 Get Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me


### ----------------------------------------------------
### MODULE 2: ACCOUNTS & PASSBOOK (FRIEND 2)
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Get Senior Balance & Spoken Text
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/balance

### 2.2 Get Visual Coin Breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/coins

### 2.3 Get Spoken Passbook Transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/passbook

### 2.4 Get Photo Contacts
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/contacts


### ----------------------------------------------------
### MODULE 3: PAYMENTS & VOICE ENGINE (FRIEND 3)
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Send 1-Tap Transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "Son Rahul",
  "amount": 500,
  "note": "Pocket Money",
  "avatar": "👨‍🦱"
}

### 3.2 High-Value Transfer (Triggers Guardian Ping)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "Son Rahul",
  "amount": 2500,
  "note": "Laptop Repair",
  "avatar": "👨‍🦱"
}

### 3.3 Voice-to-Pay Speech NLP Parser
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/voice-pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "voiceText": "Send 340 Rupees to Lakshmi Grocery"
}

### 3.4 Scan Merchant QR Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/qr-scan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qrPayload": "upi://pay?pa=lakshmigrocery@upi&pn=LakshmiStore"
}

### 3.5 Pay Electricity Bill
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/bills/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "billType": "Electricity",
  "amount": 450
}


### ----------------------------------------------------
### MODULE 4: GUARDIAN SHIELD & SOS (FRIEND 4)
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 1-Tap Emergency Account Freeze
POST {{baseUrl}}/guardian/freeze

### 4.2 Check Guardian Status & Pending Pings
GET {{baseUrl}}/guardian/status

### 4.3 Unlock Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/guardian/unfreeze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guardianPasscode": "1234"
}

### 4.4 Trigger SOS Dispatch
POST {{baseUrl}}/guardian/sos
